a('MIC-01','MIC-02','Cultured isolates or defined co-cultures could support controlled perturbation tests of community-assembly models.','A cultivation protocol does not recreate every environment or establish universal ecological laws.','enabling')
a('MIC-01','BIF-07','Cultured test organisms could provide independent reference experiments for evaluating a profiler.','The algorithm remains reference-independent; growth does not identify every function or eliminate profiling ambiguity.')
a('MIC-02','MIC-08','A model of community assembly and recovery could inform the design of a candidate functional consortium.','Prediction is not reliable deployment in every environment or every ecosystem function.','enabling')
